      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say things get better but it doesn't feel real. the version of me that people loved, the one that had a purpose and a community... that person is actually gone. everything that made me \"me\" was online. now that it's all been wiped, i dont even recognize the person sitting here. it feels like i'm just haunting my own life.",
